# Local tooling, not the site.
.claude/

# lab 2's performance workbench keeps its evidence here: ~53MB of screen
# captures, traces and run logs across 148 PNGs and 20 logs. The harnesses
# that produce them are worth keeping and are tracked; the output of a run
# that has already been read is not. Held off the deploy separately by
# .vercelignore, which excludes the whole of lab2/perf — git has no
# .vercelignore to read, so the two lists differ on purpose.
lab2/perf/results/

# The shortcuts and scratch files that live beside lab 2 on this machine.
lab2/index.html.keep-bak
lab2/*.tmp
lab2/*.bat
lab2/*.ico
lab2/*.lnk
